## Queries and actions

```js
cy.visit('/leave');
cy.get('[data-cy=new-request]').click();
cy.contains('button', 'Submit').click();
cy.get('tr').find('[data-cy=status]');
cy.get('[data-cy=note]').clear().type('flu');
cy.get('[data-cy=type]').select('Sick');
cy.get('[data-cy=file]').selectFile('cypress/fixtures/note.pdf');
cy.get('[data-cy=ok]').check();
cy.viewport('iphone-x');
```

## Assertions (retry)

```js
cy.get('[data-cy=rows]').should('have.length', 3).and('be.visible');
cy.get('[data-cy=submit]').should('be.enabled');
cy.url().should('include', '/leave');
```

## Network and API

```js
cy.intercept('GET', '/api/leave*').as('leave');
cy.visit('/leave');
cy.wait('@leave');
cy.request('POST', '/api/test-login', { role: 'manager' });
```

## Session, origin, shadow, CT

```js
cy.session('emp', () => { /* login */ });
cy.origin('https://idp.example', { args: { user, pass } }, ({ user, pass }) => {
  cy.get('#user').type(user);
  cy.get('#pass').type(pass);
  cy.get('#submit').click();
});
cy.get('hrm-select').shadow().find('input'); // or includeShadowDom: true
cy.mount(<LeaveRequestForm remainingBalance={0} />);
```

## Debug, log, artifacts

```js
cy.log('gui only');
cy.task('log', { ci: true });
cy.screenshot('step', { blackout: ['[data-cy=iban]'] });
cy.pause(); // open mode
```

## Run / CI

```bash
npx cypress open
npx cypress run --browser chrome --env grepTags=@smoke
npx cypress run --record --parallel --key "$CYPRESS_RECORD_KEY"
```

## Do not look for

`cy.switchToTab()`, `await cy.get`, `page.locator`, `driver.switchTo()`, `playwright show-trace`, built-in `toHaveScreenshot`, `--browser webkit` as first-class.

## Tiny Playwright / Selenium translation

| Cypress | Playwright | Selenium |
|---|---|---|
| `cy.get(sel)` | `locator(sel)` | `findElement` |
| `.should('be.visible')` | `expect(loc).toBeVisible()` | waits + asserts |
| `cy.intercept` | `page.route` | not built-in |
| `cy.origin` | (none needed) | (none needed) |
| `cy.mount` | CT (JS) | — |
| `cy.task` | Node `console.log` | JVM log |

Interview line: "I can write session, intercept-before-visit, origin-with-args, and task logging without opening the docs."
